                <pb facs="0444" n="336" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg336"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract from the Legislative, Executive, and
                        Judicial Appropriation Act, approved March 3, 1893.]</seg></opener>
                <p>That an act approved May twenty-fourth, eighteen hundred and ninety, entitled “An
                    act to amend an act entitled ‘An act to aid vessels wrecked or disabled in
                    waters coterminous to the United States and the Dominion of Canada,’ approved
                    June nineteenth, eighteen hundred and seventy-eight, be, and is hereby, amended
                    by striking out the words “the Welland Canal.”</p>
            </div>
